{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TPESampler","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On each trial, for each parameter, TPE fits one Gaussian Mixture Model (GMM) ","type":"text"},{"code":"l(x)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter values associated with the best-performing objective observations, and another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GMM ","type":"text"},{"code":"g(x)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the remaining observations. It selects the candidate ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" maximizing the ratio ","type":"text"},{"code":"l(x) \/ g(x)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For multi-objective optimization, TPE (MOTPE) uses non-domination ranks and hypervolume","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contributions to partition observations into the good and poor models.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Mathematical constraints set via ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/Trial\/setConstraints(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are respected during observation partitioning: feasible trials are prioritized over infeasible ones,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and infeasible trials are ordered by their total violation magnitude.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Example","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"code":["let sampler = TPESampler(seed: 42)","let study = try Swiftuna.createStudy(sampler: sampler)","try study.optimize(nTrials: 100) { trial in","    let x = try trial.suggest(\"x\", in: -10.0...10.0)","    return x * x","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/TPESampler"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftuna\/tpesampler"]}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/Sampler","doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Swiftuna10TPESamplerV","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Swiftuna"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TPESampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"TPESampler","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TPESampler","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Sampler using the Tree-structured Parzen Estimator (TPE) algorithm.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/TPESampler\/init(seed:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/TPESampler\/seed"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/TPESampler\/makeRawHandle()"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/Sampler","doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/QMCSampler","doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/GridSampler","doc:\/\/Swiftuna\/documentation\/Swiftuna\/NS